  <notesType>text/html</notesType>
  <gmNotes>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Appearance&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A rotund man with sweat-slicked skin, wearing stained silk waistcoats and a belt laden with stolen trinkets.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Personality&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Gleefully nihilistic, always snacking even amidst the apocalypse.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Background&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A former merchant who realized that when the world ends, debt becomes irrelevant.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Goals&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;To find the finest delicacies in the Shattered Coast before the sky falls.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Relationships&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;He owes a debt to the cult but finds them too loud.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Secret&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;He actually stole the cult&apos;s sacred relic and replaced it with a dried ham.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Rumor&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;They say he can predict when the next wave of madness hits by the way his belly rumbles.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Party hook&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Larry has information on a way to bypass the City&apos;s collapsing gates, but he wants a crate of fine wine first.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Voice style&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Breathless, wheezing, punctuated by chewing sounds.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Catchphrases&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Don&apos;t worry, it&apos;s all downhill from here!&lt;/p&gt;</gmNotes>
